@baseUrl = http://localhost:8088
@adminUser = admin
@adminPassword = password

### Reset scenario state
POST {{baseUrl}}/__admin/scenarios/reset
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}

### Setup: transition order to PAID
POST {{baseUrl}}/lab/api/orders/101/pay

### Mapping 04: ship order and transition to SHIPPED
POST {{baseUrl}}/lab/api/orders/101/ship
